    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a bad phase. i feel like i've been trying to \"fix\" myself for years and i just keep ending up in the same dark place. it feels like there's just a part of me that's missing or just... destroyed. like some things are just meant to stay broken.",
